That was a great series of
demos illustrating the way

00:34:39.400 --> 00:34:42.460
that we help our customers
tackle the major challenges

00:34:42.460 --> 00:34:44.350
of bilingual teams.

00:34:44.350 --> 00:34:49.100
So just recapping what
Sean just showed--

00:34:49.100 --> 00:34:51.610
through our products,
we allow data scientists

00:34:51.610 --> 00:34:54.550
to combine R and Python
in a single project using

00:34:54.550 --> 00:34:56.320
