infrastructure, where

00:35:02.620 --> 00:35:06.100
they launch the RStudio IDE.

00:35:06.100 --> 00:35:08.740
From the DevOps
and IT perspective,

00:35:08.740 --> 00:35:12.100
we make it possible to
provide all this capability

00:35:12.100 --> 00:35:15.100
in a single infrastructure
for both R, and Python,

00:35:15.100 --> 00:35:18.340
and Jupyter, which
means users can continue

00:35:18.340 --> 00:35:21.280
to use their favorite tools,
whether it's the RStudio IDE

00:35:21.280 --> 00:35:24.370
or whether it's a
Jupyter Notebook.

00:35:24.370 --> 00:35:26.980
And very importantly from
the DevOps perspective,

00:35:26.980 --> 00:35:29.770
they're making their
users happy while making

00:35:29.770 --> 00:35:33.850
their own lives simpler and
less expensive by configuring,

00:35:33.850 --> 00:35:36.280
and integrating, and scaling,
and securing a development

00:35:36.280 --> 00:35:40.960
infrastructure just once, as
opposed to multiple times.

00:35:40.960 --> 00:35:43.640
From the data science
leader's point of view,

00:35:43.640 --> 00:35:47.650
we've shown how it's easy now
to collaborate across your team,

00:35:47.650 --> 00:35:50.980
sharing your R and Python work
between those team members,

00:35:50.980 --> 00:35:57.200
maximizing their productivity,
and how to really repeatably,

00:35:57.200 --> 00:36:01.390
reproducibly deliver value
to the business by delivering

00:36:01.390 --> 00:36:04.300
regularly updated
reports, custom

00:36:04.300 --> 00:36:07.420
results, and
self-serve applications

00:36:07.420 --> 00:36:11.230
through a single portal or
directly in your stakeholder's

00:36:11.230 --> 00:36:13.437
inbox via email.

00:36:13.437 --> 00:36:15.520
And from the business
stakeholder's point of view,

00:36:15.520 --> 00:36:17.470
it's possible for
them to access all

00:36:17.470 --> 00:36:21.320
these up-to-date, interactive
analyses dashboards and emails,

00:36:21.320 --> 00:36:24.130
making sure that these results
are current since they can

00:36:24.130 --> 00:36:27.430
be updated on a scheduled
basis, and so that they

00:36:27.430 --> 00:36:29.350
can get the answers,
the insights they

00:36:29.350 --> 00:36:33.368
need when they want them in
order to make better decisions.

00:36:33.368 --> 00:36:34.160
Next slide, please.

00:36:37.290 --> 00:36:41.700
All these capabilities around
integrating with Jupyter

00:36:41.700 --> 00:36:44.172
Notebooks, supporting
Jupyter environments,

00:36:44.172 --> 00:36:45.880
supporting these
diverse bilingual teams,

