The RStudio Education
team is devoted

00:39:09.040 --> 00:39:13.540
to helping train the next
million open source data

00:39:13.540 --> 00:39:14.980
science users.

00:39:14.980 --> 00:39:18.160
We provide capabilities
around not only pointers

00:39:18.160 --> 00:39:22.600
to other learning materials
and our own learning materials,

00:39:22.600 --> 00:39:26.140
but we also provide a train
the trainer certification

00:39:26.140 --> 00:39:30.880
so that we can train people in
the open source data science

00:39:30.880 --> 00:39:36.400
community in teaching on
R and really encourage

00:39:36.400 --> 00:39:38.963
them to scale out and
provide training to others.

00:39:38.963 --> 00:39:40.630
Because we feel like
that's the best way

00:39:40.630 --> 00:39:45.790
to really get the
capabilities for using R out

00:39:45.790 --> 00:39:47.920
across the community.

00:39:47.920 --> 00:39:51.550
We're also a member of a
number of cross-vendor groups

00:39:51.550 --> 00:39:54.220
that help support the
data science community.

00:39:54.220 --> 00:39:57.550
We were one of the founders
of the R Consortium, which

00:39:57.550 --> 00:40:00.280
focuses on delivering
valuable infrastructure

00:40:00.280 --> 00:40:04.030
and supporting working
groups for the R community.

00:40:04.030 --> 00:40:06.530
We're now major sponsors
of NumFOCUS as well,

00:40:06.530 --> 00:40:09.820
which is another cross-vendor
group for supporting investment

00:40:09.820 --> 00:40:11.870
in open source data science.

00:40:11.870 --> 00:40:13.300
They're the umbrella
organization

00:40:13.300 --> 00:40:16.390
that provides the primary
funding for the Jupyter

00:40:16.390 --> 00:40:18.130
project.

00:40:18.130 --> 00:40:22.180
And we're helping
incubate Ursa Labs,

00:40:22.180 --> 00:40:24.430
providing operational
support and infrastructure

00:40:24.430 --> 00:40:27.130
for this industry-funded
development group which

00:40:27.130 --> 00:40:30.760
specializes in developing open
source data science tools that

00:40:30.760 --> 00:40:34.370
cross languages, including
most recently the Apache Arrow

00:40:34.370 --> 00:40:36.181
project.

00:40:36.181 --> 00:40:36.910
